In thinking about the inception of the idea, I remember one thing that the room got really excited about was your character previous to this episode had been pining, had been interested in Robin and had been going after her.
回想这个点子的最初构思，我记得编剧室里有一件事让大家非常兴奋，那就是在这一集之前，你的角色一直在苦苦思念罗宾（Robin），一直对她感兴趣，一直在追求她。

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:09.940
